.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt VKCUBE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vkcube
.Nd draw a cube with Vulkan
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm vkcube
and
.Nm vkcubepp
are Vulkan demonstration programs.
The option
.Fl Fl wsi Ar wayland
selects Wayland;
.Fl Fl c Ar count
ends after that many frames.
.Ev VK_ICD_FILENAMES
selects the Vulkan driver manifest.
The software driver is lavapipe.
.Xr vulkaninfo 1
prints the selected implementation and its capabilities.
